Follow the full playbook in [`.substrat/playbook.md`](/.substrat/playbook.md) before
scaffolding or extending the vertical. The always-on rules (module-code boundaries, the
gates, the two human checkpoints) live in [`AGENTS.md`](/AGENTS.md) and are always in
context — this rule is the on-demand *flow* on top of them.

Never self-approve the migration diff or the permission diff.
